===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Origin|Seadra|36}} from the {{TCG|Lost Origin}} expansion.
*'''Razor Fin''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua|Team Aqua's Carvanha|48}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Seadra}}.

